{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38142","headline":"夏课成感怀 · 韩偓","name":"夏课成感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别离终日心忉忉，五湖烟波归梦劳。\n凄凉身事夏课毕，濩落生涯秋风高。\n居世无媒多困踬，昔贤因此亦号咷。\n谁怜愁苦多衰改，未到潘年有二毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}